ng behind the  scenes  giving Putin any kind of concessions is  deeply unpleasant and distasteful  um  but just as it was better to give cruise  ship concessions in 62 rather than  increase further the risk of a nuclear  war  um you know I think there's we should be  thinking about what off-ramps in this  current situation look like you know not  least because the Ukrainian people are  going to be suffering  enormously the longer this war continues  for and again like I'm not naive about  any of this you should be very clear  Putin is not seeking an off-ramp at the  moment I'm not confident you know I'm  not just not confident like there's not  going to be serious negotiations I think  in the short term  um but that doesn't I think obviate the  value of starting to think through some  way of helping Putin extricate himself  Through This Disaster uh if he wants it  all right James action thank you very  much for talking to us today and uh yeah  we'll look forward to checking back in  with you  further down the line thank you very  much
 

